{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/304130-how-do-you-make-permanent-artifacts","id":304130,"title":"How do you make Permanent Artifacts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-05T21:03:19-08:00","id":304130,"title":"How do you make Permanent Artifacts?","content":"Ok, so we all know about the Maggot Revolver and other common Artifacts that are constructed in the Underworld, but how are powerful Artifacts made? Inhabit 5 cannot do it, so how are they made?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T22:46:16-08:00","id":304210,"title":"","content":"You're only interested in Artifacts concerning wraith? Or do other gamelines Artifacts matter to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1235-eadee","name":"Eadee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T22:55:06-08:00","id":304215,"title":"","content":"Just Wraith. Their Arcanoi only go lvl 5, that power can't create permanent Relics, nevertheless Wraiths can somehow create permanent Artifacts. I just want to know how.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T01:17:12-08:00","id":304270,"title":"","content":"IIRC the construction of artifacts is connected to the Soulforging in Stygia, but thats just a wild guess since I don't have any books at hand here at work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1235-eadee","name":"Eadee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T04:39:23-08:00","id":304439,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Soulforging\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Soulforging</a><br /> might be helpful","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1235-eadee","name":"Eadee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T07:20:40-08:00","id":304548,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Artifact_%28WTO%29\" target=\"_blank\">This part is more useful.</a><br /> <br /> Basically, Stygian Steel (which is soulsteel + Veinous Stair) Artifacts and Relic Artifacts are already going to be more powerful and long term, but very rare.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T13:37:36-08:00","id":304954,"title":"","content":"But how do you MAKE a Relic Artifact. If there are no rules for it I can just say that a Maggot Revolver requires an alloyed Arcanoi of Inhabit 5 + Pandemonium 4 while doing the soul forging, but I find it hard to believe WW kept showing amazing magical items that Wraiths manufacture, had a class called Artifcers, but never gave rules for anything but the Mage/Werewolf equivalent of Talens.<br /> <br /> Edit: Then again, they did something similar with Changeling, so maybe they did.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 11-06-2014, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T20:21:40-08:00","id":305222,"title":"","content":"One cannot make (in the sense of construct, as in Soul-forging) Relic Artifacts the same as one could make Stygian Steel Artifacts, normal Relics or Artifacts. They are, as in the link Papa Bear provided, &quot;items of great fame or renown&quot; that are &quot;maintained with emotions and memories of the Quick.&quot; In making a Relic Artifact, one would have to invest Pathos during the use of Inhabit as one does for making a normal Relic, but then would <i>also</i> have to insure some kind of (in)famous connection or emotion in the public consciousness of the Living.<br /> <br /> For example, and enterprising Wraith could have used Inhabit on the knives of Jack the Ripper, thereby creating a Relic Artifact. Or the Porsche James Dean crashed in, which supposedly killed its other owners (and was named &quot;Little Bastard&quot;).<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T22:14:20-08:00","id":305303,"title":"","content":"Nothing pretty much nailed it: Relics are not made so much as &quot;stolen&quot; from the lands of the Quick because they are objects of great significance. The Maggot Gun would only be a Relic if the gun it started as belonged to Messrs Smith, Wesson or Winchester. I can't find any specifics on Relics right now.<br /> <br /> Soul-forging is how a Wraith can make something. SHORT VERSION: Perception+Empathy to try to discover the form the soul can best be made into. Dexterity+Crafts to hammer it into that form, difficulty is the soul's Stamina and number of successes required depends on the complexity of the form. There's an Artificer specific Skill, Soulforging, which decreases the difficulty by 1. All of this, plus the details I skipped, is in the <b>Artificer's Guildbook.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}